GabaoIndex admin rework roadmap\par
\par
Goals from the request:\par
- Reduce duplicate controls and make admin navigation lighter.\par
- Fix media upload so selected files are uploaded to Firebase Storage, linked to the correct listing image field, and persisted in the shared content source.\par
- Improve listing discovery for large catalogs with better search, sorting, category filtering, and quicker edit entry points.\par
- Add direct image insertion in the edit-listing form near the latitude/longitude fields.\par
- Fix sorting, including sorting by category and by custom order.\par
- Add a mobile-first admin layout for editing on the go.\par
- Add bulk XML import support and provide a root-level example XML file.\par
- Keep this roadmap in task-note and update it as the admin work progresses.\par
\par
Implementation phases:\par
1. Audit current admin/content contract and identify every field used by the public site.\par
2. Simplify the admin HTML into a smaller set of actions and panels.\par
3. Add a better listing browser with search, category sort, order sort, and quick edit targets.\par
4. Rework media handling so uploads write to Firebase Storage and update listing fields.\par
5. Extend listing edit modal with image URL + file upload controls near coordinates.\par
6. Fix custom ordering and add category-aware sorting.\par
7. Add a mobile layout optimized for quick edits and large-touch controls.\par
8. Add XML bulk import example + parser flow and wire it into the admin UI.\par
9. Verify data persistence and public-site propagation after each major change.\par
\par
Current status:\par
- Requirements captured.\par
- Next step is admin UI/data model refactor.\par
